##### 5.3 Backend: Database Schema for De-identification ✅

**Files Modified:**
- [web_api/database.py](../../web_api/database.py)

**Tables Added:**
- `de_identification_state` - Tracks first/second pass completion and name lists
- `pii_replacements` - Audit trail of all PII replacements

**Schema:**
```sql
CREATE TABLE de_identification_state (
    job_id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    first_pass_complete BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    second_pass_complete BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    discovered_names_json TEXT,
    reviewed_names_json TEXT,
    first_pass_segments_path TEXT,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    updated_at TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE pii_replacements (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    job_id TEXT NOT NULL,
    speaker TEXT,
    original_text TEXT NOT NULL,
    replacement_text TEXT DEFAULT '[NAME]',
    word_index INTEGER,
    pass_number INTEGER,
    is_manual BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    is_override BOOLEAN DEFAULT FALSE,
    timestamp_start REAL,
    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
```

