## How to Run

**Start the API server:**
```bash
cd /Users/ai/ai-Dev/local-transcribe
uv run uvicorn web_api.main:app --reload --port 8299
```

**Start the frontend development server:**
```bash
cd web_ui
npm install
npm run dev
```

**Access:**
- API docs: http://localhost:8299/docs
- Frontend dev: http://localhost:5173
- Frontend production: Build with `npm run build`, then access via FastAPI at :8299

